==English==
{{was wotd|2015|November|6}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|tenāx||holding fast, clinging}}, from {{m|la|tenēre||to hold}} {{suffix||ious|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/təˈneɪʃəs/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-tenacious.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|eɪʃəs|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|tena|cious|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[clinging|Clinging]] to an [[object]] or [[surface]]; [[adhesive]].
# [[unwilling|Unwilling]] to [[yield]] or [[give up]]; [[dogged]].
# [[holding|Holding]] [[together]]; [[cohesive]].
# Having a good [[memory]]; [[retentive]].

